  "ruleText": "Jus 1309.02 Notice. Written notice of an adjudicative proceeding, received by prepaid certified mail by a party at least 30 days prior to the date of the hearing, shall be deemed reasonable.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Jus 1300) #9782-A, eff 9-11-10, EXPIRED: 9-11-18\n\nNew. #12656, INTERIM, eff 11-1-18, EXPIRED: 4-30-19\n\nNew. #12909, eff 10-24-19",
